{"id":"n47069-1-8","stage":4,"title":"대접 · 大碗 ","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47069-1-8-1","ko":"대접에 가득 차 있는 물을 다 마셨는데도 목이 마르네.","zh":"喝了一大碗水还觉得渴。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대접에","meaning":"大碗 ，平碗","explanation":"대접：大碗 ，平碗；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대접","audio":"/audio/5bf2e92502fa8b17a9c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47069","senseId":"1","lemma":"대접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대접에","audio":"/audio/12dc4f0323dc92f0133d.mp3"}},{"text":"가득","meaning":"挤满，装满，充满","explanation":"가득：挤满，装满，充满。","readings":[{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62661","senseId":"2","lemma":"가득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}},{"text":"차","meaning":"充满，饱含","explanation":"차다：充满，饱含；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37227","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물을","audio":"/audio/46ddd583ad8778f3f0de.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":